chapter.v:
For the 


LORD of, 


hosts has a day against all that is proud and lofty, against all that is lifted up—and it shall be brought low;

against all 


the cedars, 


of Lebanon, lofty and lifted up; and against all the oaks of Bashan;

against all 


the lofty, 


mountains, and against all the uplifted hills;

against every 


high tower,, 


and against every fortified wall;
